message: "If you use Navigation Index, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "Navigation Index"
authors:
  - family-names: Antsimonau
    given-names: Ivan
    alias: tp9imka
repository-code: "https://github.com/tp9imka/navigation-index"
url: "https://navigation-index.pages.dev/"
license: Apache-2.0
version: 0.1.0
# date-released: set to the tag date when v0.1.0 is tagged.
date-released: 2026-11-11
abstract: >-
  An open knowledge hub for navigation of small autonomous vehicles: 923
  open-source repos and 975 papers, datasets, standards and other resources
  linked in one graph, 63 runnable samples that say what ran on which data,
  and a browser Arena that races 21 path planners on a map you draw. Every
  number is labelled synthetic, SITL or real. Readable by people and by
  coding agents (llms.txt, MCP server).
keywords:
  - navigation
  - path-planning
  - obstacle-avoidance
  - drones
  - uav
  - px4
  - ardupilot
  - gnss
  - slam
  - robotics
  - pyodide
  - mcp-server
